    UiText:
      outlineWidth: 2
      text: 'The Horde marches from its gate to the human keep: goblins, orc grunts and ogres. Build towers on the stone pads beside the road: the archer shoots fast at one enemy, the cannon bursts on a group, the frost tower slows them. Raise a tower to level 3, then give it one power-up of two. A pad on high ground shoots further. Each enemy reaching the keep costs a life; kills pay gold, calling a wave early pays a bonus, a tower sells for half.'
